Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.69,0:17:03.91,LIVE Zeal Jp,NTP,0,0,0,,立ち{\3c&HEFA639&}止まらず {\3c&H0AD8A6&}前を向いて
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:06.32,LIVE Zeal Jp,NTP,0,0,0,,私{\3c&HEFA639&}たちは{\3c&H0AD8A6&}進む！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:13.22,LIVE Zeal Jp,NTP,0,0,0,,踊れ！ {\3c&HEFA639&}もっと自由に {\3c&H0AD8A6&}喜びと一緒に
